sequenceDiagram
    autonumber
    participant S as Merchant system
    participant Y as YARP
    participant M as Merchant API and inbox processor
    participant MDB as Merchant DB
    participant D as DeliveryService gRPC
    participant DDB as Delivery DB
    S->>Y: POST /api/v1/merchant/orders (SubmitMerchantOrder)
    Y->>M: X-API-Key, externalOrderId, Idempotency-Key
    M->>M: Check approved business, key scope and payload
    alt Invalid key/scope/input
        M-->>S: 401 / 403 / 400
    else Valid request
        M->>MDB: Atomic unique merchant+externalOrderId inbox job and fingerprint
        alt Changed duplicate payload
            M-->>S: 409 conflict
        else Accepted or identical duplicate
            M-->>S: 202 jobId and Location, no fabricated parcel ID
            M->>D: CreateBooking(stable merchant/order identity) service JWT
            D->>DDB: Unique identity, parcel + snapshot + history + outbox
            alt Known result
                D-->>M: BookingResult
                M->>MDB: Job Created with parcel/tracking
            else Deadline/unavailable, result unknown
                M->>MDB: Persist Retrying and schedule
                M->>D: GetBookingByExternalOrder(merchantId, externalOrderId)
                alt Existing parcel found
                    D-->>M: BookingResult
                    M->>MDB: Job Created
                else NotFound
                    M->>D: Retry CreateBooking with SAME identity and fingerprint
                end
            else Permanent domain rejection
                M->>MDB: Job Failed with safe code
            end
            S->>Y: GET /api/v1/merchant/orders/{id} (GetMerchantOrder)
            Y->>M: Own-business authorization
            M-->>S: Accepted / Retrying / Created / Failed
        end
    end
